- `/home/daniel/sandbox/src/test/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/acceptance/AcceptanceBase.java` — base with helpers `createOwnerOk(...)`, `ownerNode()`, `uniqueEmail()`, `getOwner(id)`.
- `/home/daniel/sandbox/src/test/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/acceptance/AuditLogCapture.java`.

