- `src/main/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/` with packages: `model`, `mapper`, `util`, `repository` (`jdbc`, `jpa`, `springdatajpa`), `rest` (`function/{owner,pet,vet,visit,...}`, `escalation`, `validation`), `config`, `security`. Generated DTOs at runtime under `rest/dto` (not on disk).
