- `src/test/java/.../acceptance/` as above; `src/test/resources`.
- Build: Maven (`pom.xml`, `mvnw`); this is an OfficeFloor + MapStruct + OpenAPI-generator variant of Spring PetClinic REST.

Summary of where the change lands: add a read-only `contactPreference` property to the `Owner` schema in `/home/daniel/sandbox/src/main/resources/openapi.yml`, and add the derivation (email present -> EMAIL else PHONE) as a MapStruct expression + `default` helper in `/home/daniel/sandbox/src/main/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/mapper/OwnerMapper.java` (optionally backed by a `util` helper mirroring `MembershipLevel`). No hand-written `OwnerDto.java` exists to edit — it is generated from the spec.

